/target
.env
*.json
!docs/*.json
!docs/spec/*.json
!docs/overrides/*.json
!tests/fixtures/*.json
# Staging area for chunked spec retrieval; assembled by scripts/fetch-spec.py.
docs/spec/.staging/

# Local bar store: derived data, refetchable from Tiingo, and large. The
# .ndjson files would not match the *.json rule above, so name the root.
/market-data/

# Generated chart pages: `chart --html` writes <symbol>.html into the working
# directory, and each embeds the ~160 KB charting library.
/*.html

# Python bytecode from scripts/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
